jective, dependencies,\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-34-requirements, files/data/interfaces, required behaviour, non-goals, platform\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-35-differences, verification/evidence, observable criteria, and an `## Asset\n--\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-37-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-38-## Validation procedure\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-39-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-40-Stop on an existing conflicting R ID/path. Load all three and compare their\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md:41:metadata, dependencies, provenance, and ownership to the manifest; verify\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-42-required sections and retained GATE-0003/GATE-0005 status.\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-43-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-44-## Checkpoint and update procedure\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-45-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md:46:Checkpoint B0005 only after every assigned output validates. Keep accepted\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-47-outputs and repair only an incomplete assigned path on resume.\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-48-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-49-## Stop condition\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-50-\n--\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0004.md-1----\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0004.md:2:task_id: B0004\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0004.md-3-sequence: 5\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0004.md-4-title: Author content-validation and local recovery contracts\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0004.md-