ock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/04-experience-contract.md-112-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/04-experience-contract.md-113-## Content and interaction review checklist\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/04-experience-contract.md-114-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/04-experience-contract.md:115:Before a content or UI change ships, review it against this contract: original provenance; clear next action and empty/error copy; keyboard, touch, mouse, gamepad, and semantic assistive-input operation; visible focus and accurate accessible names; contrast and non-colour cues; 44 CSS-px touch targets; 200% text/reflow; captions and reduced motion; safe save/update/recovery behaviour; destructive confirmation; and consent/minimisation for any privacy-sensitive interface.\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/04-experience-contract.md-116-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/04-experience-contract.md-117-## Open decisions retained for approval\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/04-experience-contract.md-118-\n--\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-1----\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-2-task_id: B0005\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-3-sequence: 6\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md:4:title: Author migration diagnostics and provenance contracts\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-5-browser_impact: not_applicable\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-6-playwright_spec:\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-7----\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-8-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-9-## Objective\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md-10-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/authoring-runbooks/B0005.md:11:After B0004, create only `../runbooks/R0007.md`, `../runbooks/R0009.md`, and\nprojects